      "unclassified": "BioIntel Demo\nCardiology reference page\nBioIntel demonstration record 2. The compound dofetilide was discussed with target KCNH2 in the context of cardiac arrhythmia. The example mutation is T618I. A demonstration Ki measurement of 171 nM is shown for Homo sapiens. Synthetic reference labels: SYN-PAPER-0002 and SYN-DOI-NOT-REAL-0002. This content exists only to populate document search, extraction, entity recognition, history, comparison and evidence-bridge screens.\nCompound\nTarget\nAssay\nValue nM\ndofetilide\nKCNH2\nKi\n171\nNotice:\nDemonstration/reference content only; not experimental or clinical evidence."
